            "sid": "2TI 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami Pawulu, kapostolu kaKristu Yesu mwaya muchima waNzambi, mwaya kukana kwawumi wamudi Kristu Yesu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nidi nakukusonekela mukanda, eyi mwanami Timotewu nakeŋa. Luwi nikwanakena nikuwunda kwakufuma kudi Nzambi Tata, nikudi Kristu Yesu, Mwanta wetu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namusakililaŋa Nzambi, inakalakelaŋa nachinleji chamuchima chitooka, neyi chamukalakeleluwu ankakulula jami, nanochu chinabulaŋa kunookesha kukwanuka mukulembelela kwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wufuku nimwaana, chinaanukaŋa madilu eyi, nafwilaŋa kukumona, kulonda nisweji kuzaŋalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naanukaŋa kukuhwelela kweyi kwakadi kudimbana; kwokukuhwelela kwásambilili kwikala mudi nkaka yeyi wamumbanda Lowisi, nimudi mama yeyi Yunisi, neluki nami kwekala nimudeyi nawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dihu hanafumi kukwanukisha nami wupepi chamukunkulu chaNzambi chekala mudeyi, chiwatambwili hinakunaŋikili makasami, chili muzuzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Nzambi hatwinkeli spiritu yawomaku, chiŋa yaŋovu nakukeŋa nikuwundisha mumesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi bayi wutiya nsonyi yawunsahu waMwanta wetuku, hela kutiya nsonyi hansaŋu yamami muntu windi akasawu. Kumina dakumona kukala nansaŋu yayiwahi, mwaya Ŋovu jaNzambi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "watwamwinini, watutambikili nakutambika kwajila, bayi chakunyidimu yetuku, ilaŋa mwaya kufuukula kwindi kwatufuukwililiyi, niluwi lwatutiyililiyi mudi Kristu Yesu henohu nyaka yamunyima yejima yichidi kanda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hakwila katataka analumwekeshi dehi nakumwekana kwaChamwinu chetu Kristu Yesu, wabalumwini kufwa kwikali chimwaŋaji, namwekeshi hatooka wumi nikubula kutoka, nansaŋu yayiwahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diyi nsaŋu yankunjikawu niikali mukwakuyishimuna, nikapostolu kayu, nimuleji wayu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hansaŋu iyi dihu hanafumi ami kukaba mwenimu; hela chochu, hinatiyaloŋa nsonyuku, muloŋa neluka yena nakuhwelela, neluki chikupu nami yena natweshi kuhemba chikilu chinamwinkeli kuhemba, ndo nikwifuku odu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikalaku namazu akukolesha iwatiyili kudami, mwayawu mwayawu, mukukuhwelela nikukeŋa kwekala mudi Kristu Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chijikilu chachiwahi chakukunjikiluwu, chihembi naSpiritu Wajila washakama mudetu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muneluki chananlekuwu dehi kudi ejima adi muAsiya, niaFwigelu naHemoni hamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta atiyili wushona akwetala daOnesifwolu, wankwashili kakavulu, hatiyili nsonyi yeleŋi damuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chadiŋiyi muRoma wankepakeŋeli nankashi, hakunwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi wuneluki chachiwahi yuma yayivulu yankalakeleliyi kuEfwesesa. Mwanta amwiteji awani luwi kudi Mwanta hefuku odu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
